 onDraw(draw);run();el('p','small','Each neutron flies a random distance (exponential, mean = 1 mean free path), then is absorbed or scatters in a random direction. The ± is the statistical error, which shrinks like 1/√N. This is how codes like MCNP and OpenMC design reactors.',box);
